2.1 Death Benefit
Higher of:
(a) Sum Assured = INR 50,00,000, OR
(b) Fund Value at date of death
Whichever is higher shall be paid to the Nominee.

2.2 Maturity Benefit
On survival to maturity, the Fund Value (NAV Ã— number of units held) is paid.

2.3 Partial Withdrawal
Permitted after the 5-year lock-in period. Maximum 25% of Fund Value per year. Minimum balance of INR 5,000 must be maintained.ÿ